  - THE SECONDARY-SKILL BONUS IS DROPPED AS WELL AS THE EXCLUSION. This entry
    grants eight secondary skills at +5%, where the common gargoyle''s eight
    carry no bonus at all. `secondary_skills` holds a count and a schedule; a
    category `bonus` there is a parse error by design, because the books apply
    such a bonus to RELATED picks. Both the +5% and the four excluded
    categories are in the block''s note.
  - `psionics.type` is deliberately absent, for the reason recorded on the
    Gargoyle. Note that this entry does NOT print the common gargoyle''s +1 to
    save vs psionic attacks - its +3 on all saving throws covers psionics and
    is what is stored.
  - The metamorphosis into living stone is a natural ability rather than a
    variant. Its +200 M.D.C. lasts up to six hours, three times a day, and is
    cancellable at will; `variants` carries a permanent stage rather than a
    power the character turns on and off, and a pool bonus applied
